The SVGs under `svg/` are Material Symbols by Google, from the
`@material-symbols/svg-400` npm package (the "outlined" weight-400 set).

  Material Symbols — https://github.com/google/material-design-icons
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

They are vendored verbatim as the single source of truth for both render
targets: the browser sprite / inline map and the terminal rasterizer.
